  // truncate to avoid floating point arithmetic errors
  // see: https://github.com/grommet/grommet/issues/6190
  const anglePer =
    Math.floor(((type === 'semicircle' ? 180 : 360) / max) * 10000) / 10000;
=======
  // calculate angle per unit value. small floating point imprecision
  // is preferable to dropping tiny segments entirely
  const anglePer = (type === 'semicircle' ? 180 : 360) / max;
>>>>>>> REPLACE
```

With this change, each slice—even those representing a tiny fraction of the whole—will receive the correct, nonzero angle and render as expected.
